  "body": "From here: https://matrix.org/docs/spec/application_service/unstable.html#id3\r\n\r\n\"application services now have to register via configuration files which are linked to the homeserver configuration file\"\r\n\r\nHow do I link configuration files? Where do I put it?  It's great that you have an example:\r\n```\r\nid: \"IRC Bridge\"\r\nurl: \"http://127.0.0.1:1234\"\r\nas_token: \"30c05ae90a248a4188e620216fa72e349803310ec83e2a77b34fe90be6081f46\"\r\nhs_token: \"312df522183efd404ec1cd22d2ffa4bbc76a8c1ccf541dd692eef281356bb74e\"\r\nsender_localpart: \"_irc_bot\" # Will result in @_irc_bot:domain.com\r\nnamespaces:\r\n  users:\r\n    - exclusive: true\r\n      regex: \"@_irc_bridge_.*\"\r\n  aliases:\r\n    - exclusive: false\r\n      regex: \"#_irc_bridge_.*\"\r\n  rooms: []\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut where does this go?\r\n\r\nI know this is a community effort but I find the documentation style of this project mildly infuriating. I feel like if I read the source code the documentation will start making sense. :-/",
